## File Organization

```
/app
  /(protected)     Customer-facing pages
  /admin           Admin panel
  /auth            Login, signup, onboarding
  /api             API routes
  /test            Test pages
/components
  /ui              shadcn/ui base components (DO NOT EDIT)
  /admin           Admin-specific components
  /upload          Upload-specific components
  /intelligence    Intelligence feature components
  *.tsx            Shared components
/lib
  /supabase        Supabase client setup
  /modules         Feature module exports
  *.ts             Service files
/scripts           SQL migration scripts (numbered)
/docs              Delivery plans, documentation
/public            Static assets, icons
```
